# Never sent to `docker build` (deployment-docker).

# Secrets: compose.yaml passes .env to the container at run time; it is never baked into an image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# State: a volume at run time (compose.yaml). An image with it would ship this machine's
# conversations and model credentials to wherever the image goes.
.pikit

# Installed inside the image from bun.lock, for its own platform: the project's, and each UI project's.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# The UI projects' builds (the dashboard's, a component's src/chat/): made in the image (Dockerfile's
# `ui` stage), never this machine's. Their modules (src/pikit/admin-api/dashboard-files.ts…) stay in
# the context, since their components import them: the stage writes them over with the image's own build.
src/*/dist

.git

# The originals of installed files, kept for `pikit upgrade` (pikit.json); the app never reads them.
pikit-bases
